    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce a Parental Accountability Law for Repeated Bullying",
        "additional_details": "Bullying can have a devastating and lasting impact on children\u2019s lives. Parents should be held accountable when their children repeatedly bully, threaten or physically hurt others. I am calling for stronger laws requiring parents to take responsibility for their children\u2019s bullying behaviour, with a prior review of appropriate consequences for when they fail to address it. Victims and their families deserve protection, justice and support.",
        "background": "Introduce a law holding parents accountable when their children repeatedly bully, threaten, intimidate or hurt other children. Parents should be required to take action when told of repeated bullying, with consequences for those who refuse to address it. ",
